    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1046">

                <pb facs="1146" n="1050" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1050"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dawson to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-21"><hi rendition="#italic">February 21,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 110.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge and confirm
                    your telegram as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">February 19, 1898.</hi></p>
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Chargé:</hi></p>
                        <p>Express gratitude President Moraes’ condolence.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Day</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Acting.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <pb facs="1147" n="1051" xml:id="pg1051"/>
                <p rendition="#flush">And to state that I have, complying therewith, written a note
                    to the minister for foreign affairs, a copy of which I inclose, requesting him
                    to convey to the President of Brazil the thanks of the President of the United
                    States for his message of condolence for the disaster to the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Maine.</hi></p>
                <p>The news of her destruction has called forth many expressions of regret in the
                    Brazilian press.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomas C. Dawson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1046-a1.xml" xpointer="d1046-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
